{"video_id": "N1mBJDt8Lqw", "channel_id": "UC0SrBwl_lIlvR_wpYcmCG8w", "fetched_at": "2026-11-25T03:45:49.309388+00:00", "fetch_tool": "yt-dlp 2026.08.19", "caption_track_type": "auto_generated", "segments": [{"start_seconds": 0.5, "end_seconds": 5.4, "text": "Rebuilds are cheap,"}, {"start_seconds": 2.62, "end_seconds": 8.3, "text": "[music] but cheap is not free."}, {"start_seconds": 5.4, "end_seconds": 10.8, "text": "When one tap rebuilds the whole screen,"}, {"start_seconds": 8.3, "end_seconds": 13.1, "text": "your app [music] starts to stutter."}, {"start_seconds": 10.8, "end_seconds": 14.5, "text": "So first, find the rebuilds you do not"}, {"start_seconds": 13.1, "end_seconds": 15.8, "text": "[music] need."}, {"start_seconds": 14.5, "end_seconds": 17.9, "text": "The quick way?"}, {"start_seconds": 15.8, "end_seconds": 19.1, "text": "Put a print in the build method and tap"}, {"start_seconds": 17.9, "end_seconds": 21.4, "text": "once."}, {"start_seconds": 19.1, "end_seconds": 23.9, "text": "If it prints on every tap and nothing on"}, {"start_seconds": 21.4, "end_seconds": 25.6, "text": "that widget changed, that rebuild was"}, {"start_seconds": 23.9, "end_seconds": 27.0, "text": "wasted."}, {"start_seconds": 25.6, "end_seconds": 29.1, "text": "The better way?"}, {"start_seconds": 27.0, "end_seconds": 30.6, "text": "Open Flutter DevTools."}, {"start_seconds": 29.1, "end_seconds": 33.1, "text": "The performance [music] page can count"}, {"start_seconds": 30.6, "end_seconds": 36.2, "text": "how many times each widget builds."}, {"start_seconds": 33.1, "end_seconds": 39.4, "text": "Tap once and look for the big numbers."}, {"start_seconds": 36.2, "end_seconds": 42.6, "text": "Now, [music] four ways to stop them."}, {"start_seconds": 39.4, "end_seconds": 44.6, "text": "One. Mark widgets as const."}, {"start_seconds": 42.6, "end_seconds": 47.3, "text": "A const widget is made once and [music]"}, {"start_seconds": 44.6, "end_seconds": 49.1, "text": "reused, so Flutter sees the same widget"}, {"start_seconds": 47.3, "end_seconds": 51.8, "text": "and skips it."}, {"start_seconds": 49.1, "end_seconds": 53.6, "text": "Two. Move state down."}, {"start_seconds": 51.8, "end_seconds": 56.0, "text": "When you call set [music] state,"}, {"start_seconds": 53.6, "end_seconds": 57.9, "text": "everything under that widget rebuilds."}, {"start_seconds": 56.0, "end_seconds": 59.4, "text": "So put the changing part in its own"}, {"start_seconds": 57.9, "end_seconds": 62.4, "text": "small widget."}, {"start_seconds": 59.4, "end_seconds": 65.1, "text": "Now only that [music] part rebuilds."}, {"start_seconds": 62.4, "end_seconds": 66.9, "text": "Three. Listen to less."}, {"start_seconds": 65.1, "end_seconds": 68.7, "text": "Do not watch the whole object if you"}, {"start_seconds": 66.9, "end_seconds": 71.0, "text": "only need one field."}, {"start_seconds": 68.7, "end_seconds": 73.7, "text": "Use a selector and the widget rebuilds"}, {"start_seconds": 71.0, "end_seconds": 76.7, "text": "only when that field changes."}, {"start_seconds": 73.7, "end_seconds": 78.6, "text": "Four. Pass the child through."}, {"start_seconds": 76.7, "end_seconds": 79.7, "text": "An animation builder runs on every"}, {"start_seconds": 78.6, "end_seconds": 82.2, "text": "frame."}, {"start_seconds": 79.7, "end_seconds": 84.5, "text": "Give it a child that is built once. The"}, {"start_seconds": 82.2, "end_seconds": 85.6, "text": "animation moves it but does not rebuild"}, {"start_seconds": 84.5, "end_seconds": 87.8, "text": "it."}, {"start_seconds": 85.6, "end_seconds": 89.0, "text": "Then count again. The numbers should"}, {"start_seconds": 87.8, "end_seconds": 92.1, "text": "drop."}, {"start_seconds": 89.0, "end_seconds": 93.5, "text": "Find it, fix it, and measure it."}, {"start_seconds": 92.1, "end_seconds": 96.2, "text": "Follow for more Flutter interview"}, {"start_seconds": 93.5, "end_seconds": 96.2, "text": "answers."}]}